{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Lawvere 理论"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Lawvere理论"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>语法范畴</h3>\n<p>Lawvere 理论的"},{"Local":{"url":"语法范畴","text":"语法范畴"}},{"Plain":"是满足如下条件的范畴 $\\mathcal T$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal T$ 具有有限"},{"Local":{"url":"积(范畴论)","text":"积"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal T$ 有一个对象 $x$, 使得所有对象都同构于某个 $x^n$ ($n$ 为自然数).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"代数理论","text":"代数理论"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}